        1516,
        1349
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) The Council shall be composed of not less than 11 and not more than 15 members. The Commissioner of the Office of Economic Development (the \"Commissioner\") shall be a member of the Council, but shall not be entitled to vote. The other members of the Council shall be appointed by the Mayor.",
